    "confidence": "high",
    "notes": "The exploit transaction credits the attacker with 3.531384449443560254 g(yb-tBTC), 6.935949844931976725 g(yb-cbBTC) and 6.274444990265641146 g(yb-WBTC). Six follow-up transactions redeem those shares into yb-tBTC, yb-cbBTC and yb-WBTC and then unwrap them, ending in exactly the three amounts recorded here; the components are therefore the realised BTC-denominated value of the stolen shares rather than a mark on the share tokens themselves. DefiLlama observations are within 130 seconds of the incident timestamp. Nothing was recovered."
